<span id="lstnumberx93" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx93.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">print</span><span id="lstnumberx93.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx93.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">output</span><span id="lstnumberx93.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">)</span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Solution:<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">We are given that the real numbers <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-9</annotation></semantics></math> form a **geometric sequence**. We are to find the value of <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 1: Understand the structure of a geometric sequence</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In a geometric sequence, each term is obtained by multiplying the previous term by a constant ratio <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So, if the sequence is:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1,\ a,\ b,\ c,\ -9" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">c</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">9</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1,\ a,\ b,\ c,\ -9</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Then:</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m14" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="a=-1\cdot r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=-1\cdot r</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="b=a\cdot r=(-1\cdot r)\cdot r=-r^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=a\cdot r=(-1\cdot r)\cdot r=-r^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m16" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="c=b\cdot r=-r^{2}\cdot r=-r^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=b\cdot r=-r^{2}\cdot r=-r^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m17" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="-9=c\cdot r=-r^{3}\cdot r=-r^{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-9=c\cdot r=-r^{3}\cdot r=-r^{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 2: Use the last term to solve for <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are told the last term is <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-9</annotation></semantics></math>, so:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-r^{4}=-9" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">9</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-r^{4}=-9</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Divide both sides by <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{4}=9" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{4}=9</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now solve for <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=\pm\sqrt[4]{9}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">±</mo><mroot style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">9</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn></mroot></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\pm\sqrt[4]{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Note that <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt[4]{9}=\sqrt{\sqrt{9}}=\sqrt{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mroot style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></mroot><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt[4]{9}=\sqrt{\sqrt{9}}=\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, so:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=\pm\sqrt{3}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">±</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\pm\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 3: Find <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=-r^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=-r^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Recall that:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=-r^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=-r^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now compute <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> for both values of <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.24" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.24.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- If <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=\sqrt{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{2}=(\sqrt{3})^{2}=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{2}=(\sqrt{3})^{2}=3</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break">- If <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=-\sqrt{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=-\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A7.T2a.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{2}=(-\sqrt{3})^{2}=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{2}=(-\sqrt{3})^{2}=3</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.25" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.25.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So in both cases:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=-r^{2}=-3" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=-r^{2}=-3</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.26" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.26.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.27" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2a.pic1.2.27.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Final Answer:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{-3}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">3</mn></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T2a.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Case 2</span>: </span><span id="A7.T2a.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Geometric Sequence Problem: Solving for <math id="A7.T2a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> in a geometric sequence with given terms.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
