<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Solution:<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">We are asked to calculate the expression:</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{12}+|1-\sqrt{3}|+(\pi-2023)^{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">12</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2023</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{12}+|1-\sqrt{3}|+(\pi-2023)^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let’s break it down step by step.</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 1: Simplify <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{12}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">12</mn></msqrt><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We can simplify the square root:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{12}=\sqrt{4\cdot 3}=\sqrt{4}\cdot\sqrt{3}=2\sqrt{3}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">12</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">4</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">4</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{12}=\sqrt{4\cdot 3}=\sqrt{4}\cdot\sqrt{3}=2\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 2: Simplify <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|1-\sqrt{3}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|1-\sqrt{3}|</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We know that <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{3}\approx 1.732" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≈</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1.732</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{3}\approx 1.732</annotation></semantics></math>, so:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\sqrt{3}\approx 1-1.732=-0.732" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">≈</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1.732</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">0.732</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\sqrt{3}\approx 1-1.732=-0.732</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Since the result is negative, the absolute value is:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|1-\sqrt{3}|=\sqrt{3}-1" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|1-\sqrt{3}|=\sqrt{3}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 3: Simplify <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\pi-2023)^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2023</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\pi-2023)^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Any non-zero number raised to the power of 0 is 1. Since <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi\approx 3.1416" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≈</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3.1416</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\approx 3.1416</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A7.T4a.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi-2023\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2023</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≠</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi-2023\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\pi-2023)^{0}=1" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2023</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">0</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\pi-2023)^{0}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 4: Add all the simplified parts</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now, add the three parts together:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{12}+|1-\sqrt{3}|+(\pi-2023)^{0}=2\sqrt{3}+(\sqrt{3}-1)+1" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">12</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2023</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">0</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{12}+|1-\sqrt{3}|+(\pi-2023)^{0}=2\sqrt{3}+(\sqrt{3}-1)+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Simplify:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{3}-1+1=3\sqrt{3}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{3}-1+1=3\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T4a.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Final Answer:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{3\sqrt{3}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.800em">3</mn></msqrt></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{3\sqrt{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T4a.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Case 4</span>: </span><span id="A7.T4a.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Mathematical Expression Calculation: Solving the expression involving square roots, absolute values, and exponentiation. The table provides a detailed breakdown of the problem-solving steps and the corresponding Python code implementation.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
