<span id="lstnumberx144" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx144.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_comment ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">#<span id="lstnumberx144.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Call<span id="lstnumberx144.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx144.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>function<span id="lstnumberx144.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>with<span id="lstnumberx144.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx144.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>input<span id="lstnumberx144.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dictionary,<span id="lstnumberx144.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>assign<span id="lstnumberx144.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx144.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>result<span id="lstnumberx144.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="lstnumberx144.1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>’output’</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx145" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx145.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">output</span><span id="lstnumberx145.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx145.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">find_tangent_coefficient</span><span id="lstnumberx145.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(**</span><span id="lstnumberx145.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_lst_keywords2 ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">input</span><span id="lstnumberx145.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">)</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx146" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx146.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_comment ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">#<span id="lstnumberx146.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Print<span id="lstnumberx146.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx146.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>output</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx147" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx147.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">print</span><span id="lstnumberx147.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx147.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">output</span><span id="lstnumberx147.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">)</span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Solution:<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">We are given:</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A **line**: <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x-y-1=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x-y-1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A **parabola**: <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=ax^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are told that the **line and the parabola are tangent to each other**, which means they intersect at **exactly one point** (i.e., the system has exactly one solution).</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 1: Solve the system of equations</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are given:</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x-y-1=0\Rightarrow y=x-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x-y-1=0\Rightarrow y=x-1</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=ax^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Substitute the expression for <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> from the line into the parabola:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x-1=ax^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x-1=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rewriting:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ax^{2}-x+1=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ax^{2}-x+1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is a **quadratic equation** in <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ax^{2}-x+1=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ax^{2}-x+1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">—</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Step 2: Use the condition for tangency</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For the line and the parabola to be **tangent**, the quadratic equation must have **exactly one solution**. That means the **discriminant** of the quadratic must be zero.</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Recall that for a quadratic <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ax^{2}+bx+c=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ax^{2}+bx+c=0</annotation></semantics></math>, the discriminant is:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=b^{2}-4ac" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">b</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">c</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=b^{2}-4ac</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In our case, the quadratic is:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ax^{2}-x+1=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ax^{2}-x+1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So:</span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p"><math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=a</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=-1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=1</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now compute the discriminant:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=(-1)^{2}-4(a)(1)=1-4a" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=(-1)^{2}-4(a)(1)=1-4a</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.24" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.24.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Set the discriminant equal to zero (for tangency):</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-4a=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-4a=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.25" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.25.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Solve for <math id="A7.T5a.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4a=1\Rightarrow a=\frac{1}{4}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4a=1\Rightarrow a=\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.26" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T5a.pic1.2.26.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### Final Answer:</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{\frac{1}{4}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.700em">4</mn></mfrac></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\frac{1}{4}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T5a.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Case 5</span>: </span><span id="A7.T5a.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Tangency Condition of Line and Parabola: Finding the value of <math id="A7.T5a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> for the line and parabola to be tangent.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
